// Projects over the WorkGraph (REQ-PX-063; docs/62, docs/65 AFW-J01..J04).
//
// A Project is a named, archivable record bound to one workspace, with an
// external membership map from task to project. It is a grouping: it carries
// no coordinator behaviour, schedules nothing and owns no task, and archiving
